<div class="image-cover-container hero-overlay crop-top no-chevron hero-no-mobile-overlay">
  
            <div class="field field--name-field-news-cover-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="view-mode-cover-image media media-image"><div class="field field--name-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item" data-mid="189721"><img loading="eager" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/third_1x_crop/public/images/2026/01/20240904_CommsKickoff_MR_038.jpg?itok=pFM2foSw 640w, /sites/default/files/styles/half_1x_crop/public/images/2026/01/20240904_CommsKickoff_MR_038.jpg?itok=7ycoK_G1 960w, /sites/default/files/styles/half_16_9_1440/public/images/2026/01/20240904_CommsKickoff_MR_038.jpg?itok=dBy5nRSj 1440w, /sites/default/files/styles/1x_full_2x_half_crop/public/images/2026/01/20240904_CommsKickoff_MR_038.jpg?itok=7CqGXRRp 1920w, /sites/default/files/styles/crop_2048_ipad/public/images/2026/01/20240904_CommsKickoff_MR_038.jpg?itok=fAEL7zta 2048w, /sites/default/files/styles/full_2x_crop/public/images/2026/01/20240904_CommsKickoff_MR_038.jpg?itok=oLDP-FeA 2880w" sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1080" src="/sites/default/files/styles/1x_full_2x_half_crop/public/images/2026/01/20240904_CommsKickoff_MR_038.jpg?itok=7CqGXRRp" alt="President Eisgruber " /></div></div></div>
      
  <div class="image-caption-overlay hero">
    <div class="contents">
      <h2 style="">
        <a href="/news/2026/02/02/president-eisgrubers-state-university-letter-2026"><span class="balance-text"><span>President Eisgruber&#039;s State of the University letter, 2026</span>
</span></a>
      </h2>
      
                      <div>
            Eisgruber sent his 10th annual State of the University letter, titled “From Growth to Focus,” to faculty, students and staff on Monday, Feb. 2.&nbsp;
      </div>
         
          </div>
  </div>
</div>

